<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'60px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei', display:'flex', flexDirection:'column' }}>
<Box style={{ height:46, flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'baseline', gap:18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>模块独立性与数据流设计</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 4.4–4.5 节 · 变换流与事务流</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6B61', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>FTDMS · 总体设计报告</Text><Image src="assets/logo_icon.png" style={{ width: 36, height: 36, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:1, background:'#CFD9D2', marginTop:8, marginBottom:20 }}></Box>
<Box style={{ height:462, flexDirection:'column', gap:18 }}><Box style={{ height:240, flexDirection:'row', gap:36 }}><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>内聚与耦合</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>总体取向：模块内功能内聚，模块间优先数据耦合<br />限制公共环境耦合，完全不用内容耦合<br />鉴权与资料分离、计划与实际记录分服务、换算器抽为纯函数<br />营养快照使饮食记录与食物库解耦</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex:1, flexDirection:'column', gap:10, padding:'0 4px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>面向数据流：P1–P6 六个加工</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>记录类请求是变换流：输入校验 → 内部加工 → 持久化 → 输出<br />登录 / AI 授权与生成是事务流：先判类型，再选活动通路<br />P1 账户 → A；P2 训练 → B、G；P3 饮食 → C、G<br />P4 身体 → D；P5 统计 → E；P6 AI 分析 → F</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height:204, flexDirection:'column', gap:0 }}><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>改进结构</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>计划 / 记录、食物 / 快照、报告 / 原始记录分离 → 变更局限单模块</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>规模适中</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>单 service 约 150–300 行，单测覆盖关键规则 → 可读、可测</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', borderBottom:'1px solid #CFD9D2', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>深度与宽度</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>深度 4、宽度 8、扇出 ≤6、扇入 ≤3 → 无蜘蛛网式调用</Text></Box><Box style={{ height:51, flexDirection:'row', gap:20, alignItems:'center', padding:'0 6px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#14563F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, width: 140 }}>消除重复</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>统一响应与错误码、日期与换算工具集中 → 全系统口径唯一</Text></Box></Box></Box>
<Box style={{ height:50, marginTop:9, background:'#F4F8F5', flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', padding:'0 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1C2A24', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>结构图与数据流图共用 P1–P6 编号，需求阶段与设计阶段可直接对照验收。</Text></Box>
</Slide>
